{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/782419-ex3-sidereal-astrology-workings-ex2-rule-hack","id":782419,"title":"[Ex3] Sidereal Astrology Workings (Ex2 rule hack)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-08T12:01:26-08:00","id":782419,"title":"[Ex3] Sidereal Astrology Workings (Ex2 rule hack)","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Exalted 3rd Sidereal Astrology</b></span><br /> <br /> Sorcerous Working with\u2026<br /> <b>Charisma + Performance + [Relevant College]</b><br /> or<br /> <b>Essence + [Ability of the College] + [Relevant College]</b> (individual College points bought as Merit for 3xp)<br /> \u2026instead of Intelligence + Occult<br /> <b>Base Interval: 4h</b> instead of one week<br /> <b>Paradox points (sic) instead of XP costs</b><br /> <br /> Astrology modifiers like petitions and countersignatures count as Means.<br /> Extra Time changes the interval to days<br /> <br /> <b>Terrestrial Fate Workings </b>can be produced in Creation.<br /> <br /> <b>Celestial Fate Workings</b> require direct access to the Loom of Fate<br /> <br /> <b>Sidereal Fate Workings</b> count as \u201cBeyond the Boundaries\u201d to represent the possibilities for things going awry fast and require access to the Loom of Fate. The base interval increases to 2 days.<br /> <br /> The Fate Circle is defined by the highest requirement of scope or duration.<br /> <br /> <i>In short: What increased the paradox dice pool by one requires Celestial Fate Workings and what increased the pool by 3 requires Sidereal Fate Workings, with the exception of Frequency and Triggers</i> <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Scope</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Terrestrial Fate Workings</b><br /> 0. Individual<br /> 1. Individual Alone<br /> 2. Small Group or Clique<br /> 3. Extended Family or Hamlet<br /> 4. Clan or Village (Censure)<br /> <br /> <b>Celestial Fate Workings</b><br /> 5. Town or Neighborhood (Censure)<br /> 6. City (Censure)<br /> <br /> <b>Sidereal Fate Workings</b><br /> 7. Principality or Prefecture (Censure)<br /> 8. Kingdom or Dominion (Censure)<br /> 9. Local Region (Censure)<br /> 10. Astrological Direction (Censure) <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Duration</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Terrestrial Fate Workings</b><br /> 0. A Month<br /> 1. A Season<br /> 2. A Year<br /> <br /> <b>Celestial Fate Workings</b><br /> 3. 10 Years<br /> 4. 20 Years<br /> <br /> <b>Sidereal Fate Workings</b><br /> 5. 60 Years<br /> 6. 140 Years (Censure)<br /> 7. 260 Years (Censure)<br /> 8. 600 Years (Censure)<br /> 9. 1000 Years (Censure)<br /> 10. 2000 Years (Censure) <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Frequency</b></span><br /> Is represented by <b>Ambition </b>at Storyteller\u2019s discretion<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Triggers</b></span><br /> Are represented by <b>Finesse </b>at Storyteller\u2019s discretion<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Resplendent Destinies</b></span><br /> Count as Terrestrial Fate Workings up to a year, as Celestial Fate Workings up to 20 years and as Sidereal Fate Workings above that time period.<br /> <br /> The circle can be voluntarily increased to gain more endurance (see below).<br /> <br /> The Endurance is defined by the goal number of the Ambition. (An Ambition 2 Celestial Fate Working Resplendent destiny has 30 Endurance)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://owncloud.scaenicus.net/index.php/s/saLcZXhVcOu0j3W/download?path=%2F&amp;files=ScaenicusBacked_big.png&amp;downloadStartSecret=mflqpfu2cd8\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/ScaenicusBacked.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":1491,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1491-scaenicus","user":"Scaenicus","date":". 01-06-2016, 07:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1491-scaenicus","name":"Scaenicus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T12:05:02-08:00","id":782422,"title":"","content":"In general the idea was:<br /> 1. There should be a benefit for Sidereals to work the Loom of Fate (no xp costs, shorter base interval, higher dice pool through Colleges) vs. making Sorcerous Working more viable than Astrology.<br /> 2. I want to make Resplendencies more useful (increasing Endurance).<br /> 3. For all the benefits there is the omnipresent oversight of Yu-Shan and a faster increase of Paradox.<br /> 4. Increase benefits for non-Ronin<br /> <br /> What are your thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://owncloud.scaenicus.net/index.php/s/saLcZXhVcOu0j3W/download?path=%2F&amp;files=ScaenicusBacked_big.png&amp;downloadStartSecret=mflqpfu2cd8\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/ScaenicusBacked.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":1491,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1491-scaenicus","user":"Scaenicus","date":". 12-08-2015, 03:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1491-scaenicus","name":"Scaenicus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T12:22:47-08:00","id":782433,"title":"","content":"I like it. It's similar in places to some ideas I had on the subject, though admittedly quite different in others.<br /> <br /> I am wondering how Finesse is worked out though? One thought I had on reading this is that you could have that be the Essence problem, so the astrological destiny can only affect those with Essence equal to or less than the Finesse. Alternately the Sidereal MUST take into account higher Essence beings when making destinies. This would make destinies that cover a larger area more difficult due to the likelihood of a higher Essence being being under it's effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My attempt at a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15dK8fZaL-Kn-yGKxW6VRg_z6aF27FqbIf-t8ZEXmMC4/edit?pref=2&amp;pli=1#\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal 3e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8793-grifftofer","name":"Grifftofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T12:29:33-08:00","id":782438,"title":"","content":"Sorry just edited the first post (Copy/Paste error):<br /> Triggers are represented by Finesse at Storyteller\u2019s discretion.<br /> <br /> e.g. Bless a town to become renowned for the metalwork<br /> Low Finesse: The Storyteller might come up with a notorious highwayman who uses famously a sword from this town. Mercenaries, bandits and player characters start to flock to the town to profit from the craftsmen there.<br /> High Finesse: Every metalwork from this town prevents a botch due to high stress, wear and tear once every week. This makes the town renowned for the high quality.<br /> <br /> But I like your idea to take beings with Essence into account for Finesse. For reference: Ex2 calculated the Essence into the scope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://owncloud.scaenicus.net/index.php/s/saLcZXhVcOu0j3W/download?path=%2F&amp;files=ScaenicusBacked_big.png&amp;downloadStartSecret=mflqpfu2cd8\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/ScaenicusBacked.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":1491,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1491-scaenicus","user":"Scaenicus","date":". 12-08-2015, 03:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1491-scaenicus","name":"Scaenicus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T12:33:56-08:00","id":782440,"title":"","content":"Yeah. But it also made you go and shake hands with them all too in order to affect them :P (figuratively at least)<br /> <br /> Edit: Hope that disappears this edition","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My attempt at a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15dK8fZaL-Kn-yGKxW6VRg_z6aF27FqbIf-t8ZEXmMC4/edit?pref=2&amp;pli=1#\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal 3e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8793-grifftofer","name":"Grifftofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T12:35:55-08:00","id":782442,"title":"","content":"Yes the fine print of Ex2 Astrology <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://owncloud.scaenicus.net/index.php/s/saLcZXhVcOu0j3W/download?path=%2F&amp;files=ScaenicusBacked_big.png&amp;downloadStartSecret=mflqpfu2cd8\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/ScaenicusBacked.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1491-scaenicus","name":"Scaenicus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T13:03:12-08:00","id":783021,"title":"","content":"Tying it to one attribute / ability seems kind of problematic (as it was in 2E, really). Sorcerous Workings are only for sorcerers, but Astrology is supposed to be for all Sidereals. I think it's kind of icky for the entire splat feature to be far weaker for Sidereals that choose to focus on a different social attribute than Charisma, or a different social ability than Performance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T06:02:19-08:00","id":785350,"title":"","content":"I understand what you mean. You could replace the Attribute with Essence, an Ability is okay I think - Because the other option would be to create a complete new ability for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://owncloud.scaenicus.net/index.php/s/saLcZXhVcOu0j3W/download?path=%2F&amp;files=ScaenicusBacked_big.png&amp;downloadStartSecret=mflqpfu2cd8\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/ScaenicusBacked.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1491-scaenicus","name":"Scaenicus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T13:24:51-08:00","id":785539,"title":"","content":"I think someone in another thread suggested basing it off the Ability of the College you're making it for, with extra College dots as a Merit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-05T13:09:09-08:00","id":801571,"title":"","content":"You are right. I forgot that Colleges are bound to an ability.<br /> <br /> Edit: I edited the first post.<br /> Now Sidereals can be played as experts in specific Colleges (represented by Essence + Ability + College) or as general Fate Weavers and experts in influencing the Pattern Spiders (Charisma + Performance + College).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://owncloud.scaenicus.net/index.php/s/saLcZXhVcOu0j3W/download?path=%2F&amp;files=ScaenicusBacked_big.png&amp;downloadStartSecret=mflqpfu2cd8\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/ScaenicusBacked.png\" borde